  "description": "XrmToolBox tool that migrates model-driven app themes from a source to a target Dataverse environment with the same configuration, icons and GUIDs: classic themes (all colors and the logo) and modern New look theme settings (Custom theme definition and Override app header color, at environment and app level) together with their theme XML and logo web resources. Shows a preview of what will be created or updated in the target, protects Microsoft system themes, and can optionally publish the migrated theme and set it as the default.",
